title: Reject non-object tsconfig output in the exact coverage gate
description: "CodeRabbit found that valid JSON primitives from tsc --showConfig either throw a raw TypeError or silently select default paths. Add failing tests first, then validate a non-null non-array object before reading compilerOptions."
